wand of wish (DL4), and wished for blessed scrolls of charging and a
suit of blessed +2 gray dragon scale mail. Also dipped for Excalibur.
No magic whistle yet.

She found a polymorph trap on DL7 (IIRC)... after dispatching an ice
vortex and a baby orange dragon. I decided to polymorph her pet cat --
which is still a kitty, since valks do not rely on pets.

First a centipede, and then, a lawful unicorn.

At first I thought about arranging an accident -- so I can get an easy
unicorn horn. But then she hasn't finished Sokoban yet - from my past
experience, I can often find unicorns in there.

So do you think it is worthwhile to keep the unicorn around? How tough
is it? Do I use it as a portable luck generator and/or source of
unicorn horn, or should I polymorph it for better results?



